  reserved reasons 372/373, which do not exist on this branch (the
  enum ends at 354). The two reasons are added as new values 355 and
  356 instead, with matching enums.xml entries.
- render_frame_host_impl.cc: context drift only (blank line); the two
  PDF-process checks are inserted as upstream.
- public_url_manager.cc: include hunks adapted to this branch's
  include list (adds features.h, local_frame.h, local_frame_client.h;
  the branch does not have the blob.mojom-blink-forward.h /
  media_source includes upstream's context expects). Code hunks
  applied as upstream.
- url_file_api.cc: comment-only hunk; this branch still calls
  DOMURL::CreatePublicURL(), the comment was adjusted accordingly.
- chrome_site_per_process_browsertest.cc and public_url_manager_test.cc
  (test-only) conflicted on unrelated upstream test scaffolding and
  are kept as on the branch. blob_url_browsertest.cc, features.cc/.h,
